{"id": "17-3072-2-14", "zh": "被动语态中，依“yamhi dādhāmāṭhāhāpāmahamathādīnamī”这条规则，词根末音变为 ī。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3072-15-20", "zh": "Hīyate、hīyante、hīyare。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3072-21-24", "zh": "Hīyati、hīyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3073-2-6", "zh": "同样有：jahātu、jahantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3073-7-12", "zh": "Jahe、jaheyya、jaheyyuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3073-13-16", "zh": "Hīyetha、hīyeyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3073-17-22", "zh": "Ajahāsi、ajahiṃsu、ajahāsuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3073-23-30", "zh": "Pajahi、pajahiṃsu、pajahaṃsu、pajahuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3073-31-35", "zh": "被动语态：pajahīyittha、pajahīyi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3073-36-39", "zh": "Pajahissati、pajahissanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3073-40-43", "zh": "Hīyissati、hīyissanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3073-44-48", "zh": "Pajahissa、pajahissaṃsu，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3074-2-17", "zh": "词根 dā 表示“给予”。加上 ti 等语尾，词根重复并变短音，删去词缀 a，得到 dadāti、dadanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3074-18-21", "zh": "Dadāsi、dadātha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3074-22-25", "zh": "Dadāmi、dadāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3075-2-11", "zh": "在不重复的情况下，“vā”（或）一词按“蛙跳”的方式延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3076-2-7", "zh": "507. 词根 dā 变为 dajja。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3077-2-17", "zh": "词根 dā 整个可以替换为 dajja；这里的 vā 一词表示有定的选择（vavatthitavibhāsā）；删去词缀 a。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3077-18-21", "zh": "Dajjati、dajjanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3077-22-25", "zh": "Dajjasi、dajjatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3077-26-29", "zh": "Dajjāmi、dajjāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3077-30-47", "zh": "不替换为 dajja 时，依“lopañcettamakāro”这条规则，词缀 a 变为 e，得到 dānaṃ deti（他布施）、denti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3077-48-51", "zh": "Desi、detha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3078-2-9", "zh": "“vā”（或）一词延续下来。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3079-2-7", "zh": "508. 在 mi、ma 之前，dā 的末音变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3080-2-15", "zh": "后面接 mi、ma 时，词根 dā 的末音可以变为 aṃ；鼻音（niggahīta）变为同组的鼻音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3080-16-19", "zh": "Dammi、damma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3080-20-23", "zh": "Demi、dema。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3081-2-16", "zh": "被动语态中，依“yamhi dādhā”等规则变为 ī，得到 dīyate、dīyante。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3081-17-20", "zh": "Dīyati、dīyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3081-21-24", "zh": "Dīyyate、dīyyante。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3081-25-30", "zh": "或者 dīyyati、dīyyanti，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3082-2-6", "zh": "Dadātu、dadantu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3082-7-10", "zh": "Dadāhi、dadātha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3082-11-14", "zh": "Dadāmi、dadāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3082-15-18", "zh": "Dadataṃ、dadantaṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3082-19-22", "zh": "Dadassu、dadavho。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3082-23-26", "zh": "Dade、dadāmase。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3082-27-31", "zh": "Dajjatu、dajjantu，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3082-32-35", "zh": "Detu、dentu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3082-36-39", "zh": "Dehi、detha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3082-40-43", "zh": "Demi、dema。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3082-44-48", "zh": "被动语态：dīyataṃ、dīyantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3082-49-52", "zh": "Dīyatu、dīyantu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3083-2-8", "zh": "祈愿式（sattamī）：dade、dadeyya、dadeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3083-9-12", "zh": "Dadeyyāsi、dadeyyātha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3083-13-16", "zh": "Dadeyyāmi、dadeyyāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3083-17-20", "zh": "Dadetha、daderaṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3083-21-24", "zh": "Dadetho、dadeyyāvho。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3083-25-28", "zh": "Dadeyyaṃ、dadeyyāmhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3083-29-32", "zh": "Dajje、dajjeyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3084-2-16", "zh": "依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，eyya 也可变为 ā，得到 dajjā、dajjuṃ、dajjeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3084-17-20", "zh": "Dajjeyyāsi、dajjeyyātha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3084-21-30", "zh": "Dajjaṃ（eyyāmi 也替换为 aṃ）；dajjeyyāmi、dajjeyyāma。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3084-31-35", "zh": "不重复时：deyya、deyyuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3084-36-39", "zh": "Deyyāsi、deyyātha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3084-40-43", "zh": "Dīyetha、dīyeyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3085-2-6", "zh": "昨天过去时（hiyyattanī）：adadā、adadū。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3085-7-10", "zh": "Adado、adadattha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3085-11-14", "zh": "Adadaṃ、adadamha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3085-15-18", "zh": "Adadattha、adadamhase。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3085-19-21", "zh": "被动语态：adīyittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3086-2-8", "zh": "今天过去时（ajjatanī）：adadi、adadiṃsu、adaduṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3086-9-12", "zh": "Adajji、adajjiṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3086-13-16", "zh": "Adāsi、adaṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3086-17-22", "zh": "Adāsi、ado、adittha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3086-23-28", "zh": "Adāsiṃ、adāsimha、adamha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3086-29-31", "zh": "例如 adā dānaṃ purindado（布林达达曾经布施）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3086-32-36", "zh": "被动语态：adīyittha、adīyyi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3087-2-10", "zh": "将来时（bhavissantī）：增加 i 音，并删去元音等，得到 dadissati、dadissanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3087-11-14", "zh": "Dajjissati、dajjissanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3087-15-20", "zh": "变为短音，得到 dassati、dassanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3087-21-24", "zh": "Dassasi、dassatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3087-25-28", "zh": "Dassāmi、dassāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3087-29-30", "zh": "Dassate。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3087-31-34", "zh": "Dīyissate、dīyissati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3088-2-14", "zh": "条件式（kālātipatti）：adadissa、adajjissa、adajjissā、adassa、adassā、adassaṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3088-15-19", "zh": "Adīyissatha、adīyissa，等等。", "confidence": 90}
